       "explain": "$M(1)=1$, $M(2)=2$, $M(3)=1$, $M(4)=1$, $M(5)=2$ ו-$M(6)=1+\\min\\bigl(M(5),M(3),M(2)\\bigr)=1+\\min(2,1,2)=2$. זה $3+3$.",
